Apply summarization.reserveRatio exactly once

LibreChat applied reserveRatio when computing the agent's maxContextTokens and
@librechat/agents applied it again in pruning (its own default 0.05 when unset).
Compute base * (1 - reserveRatio) once here (capped by a user/spec value, default
ratio 0.05) and pass reserveRatio 0 to the library.

